  "findings": [
    "All14 long-identifier originals individually opened/hash matched. Real overlapping pans show complete long endpoint/model/client values and endings/carets above real visible keys and Select all/Done; long model spans more than one viewport. Exact full-value assertions and four saved-state checkpoints verify typing/discard/reopen/cleanup.",
    "Immediate typed-value stills(2/8/12) show accessory without drawn keys; those are not used as drawn-keyboard proof. Subsequent panned start/end frames have real visible keys. Do not conflate passing keyboard-exists assertions with actual pixels.",
    "Remaining30 largest-mode originals still to review; both tests terminal passed,19 exact readbacks,0 packets. Full compact/continuing critic/Release/publication acceptance open.",
    "All44 R48 originals now individually opened/hash matched. Main largest native provider/connection choices show all labels. Full content/Google configuration/Keychain footer paragraphs and built-in detail/photo status are visible through actual scroll frames. Full client/scope/model selections are readable; long selected preset endpoint partly under accessory is supplemented by the complete typed-long endpoint start/end sequence. Native preference thumb states visible. Saved/draft sign-in distinction and API restoration match exact recorded native states."
  ],
  "acceptance": "main largest functional and full44-original visual review scoped pass; compact/continuing critic/Release/publication remain open"
}
